    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p20-q13-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$$\\binom{2n}{0}+\\binom{2n}{2}+\\binom{2n}{4}+\\cdots+\\binom{2n}{2n}=2^{2n-1}.$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$$\\binom{2n}{0}+\\binom{2n}{2}+\\cdots+\\binom{2n}{2n}=2^{2n-1}.$$\n\nAdd the identities obtained from $x=1$ and $x=-1$, then divide by 2.",
          "worked": "Substituting $x=1$ gives\n$$\\binom{2n}{0}+\\binom{2n}{1}+\\binom{2n}{2}+\\cdots+\\binom{2n}{2n}=2^{2n}.$$\nSubstituting $x=-1$ gives\n$$\\binom{2n}{0}-\\binom{2n}{1}+\\binom{2n}{2}-\\cdots+\\binom{2n}{2n}=0.$$\nAdding cancels the odd-index terms:\n$$2\\left(\\binom{2n}{0}+\\binom{2n}{2}+\\binom{2n}{4}+\\cdots+\\binom{2n}{2n}\\right)=2^{2n}.$$\nDividing by 2 gives\n$$\\binom{2n}{0}+\\binom{2n}{2}+\\binom{2n}{4}+\\cdots+\\binom{2n}{2n}=2^{2n-1}.$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 68
      },
      {
        "id": "p20-q13-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Does this sum also have the same simple form?\n$$\\binom{2n}{1}+\\binom{2n}{3}+\\binom{2n}{5}+\\cdots+\\binom{2n}{2n-1}$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Yes.\n$$\\binom{2n}{1}+\\binom{2n}{3}+\\cdots+\\binom{2n}{2n-1}=2^{2n-1}.$$\n\nSubtract the $x=-1$ identity from the $x=1$ identity, then divide by 2.",
          "worked": "Subtracting the $x=-1$ identity from the $x=1$ identity in part a cancels the even-index terms and doubles the odd-index terms:\n$$2\\left(\\binom{2n}{1}+\\binom{2n}{3}+\\binom{2n}{5}+\\cdots+\\binom{2n}{2n-1}\\right)=2^{2n}.$$\nDividing by 2 gives\n$$\\binom{2n}{1}+\\binom{2n}{3}+\\binom{2n}{5}+\\cdots+\\binom{2n}{2n-1}=2^{2n-1}.$$\nYes, the odd-index sum has the same simple form.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 52
      }
    ]
  },
